      "created": 1791025675,
      "updated": 1791025676
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac0e20c00000000000023ce",
      "text": " かわいい声を出すのが難しい",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1791025676,
      "updated": 1791025685
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac0e21400000000000023cf",
      "text": "  RVCもロボっぽくなる瞬間などがあり調整が難しい",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1791025685,
      "updated": 1791025708
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac0fb960000000000558d16",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1791032214,
      "updated": 1791032215
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac0fb960000000000558d17",
      "text": "[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1791032215,
      "updated": 1791032216
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac0fb970000000000558d18",
      "text": " 自宅サーバーでlocal LLM動かしたい",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1791032216,
      "updated": 1791032222
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac0fb9d0000000000558d19",
      "text": " [Hermes Agent]でGPU調べてた",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1791032222,
      "updated": 1791032232
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac0fba80000000000558d1a",
      "text": "  [RTX3090]と[qwen3.8-27B]の組み合わせがいいらしい",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1791032232,
      "updated": 1791032251
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac0fbba0000000000558d1b",
      "text": "  GPUボード、30万~50万するんだけど……",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1791032251,
      "updated": 1791032271
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac0fbce0000000000558d1c",
      "text": "   高すぎ！買えない！",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1791032271,
      "updated": 1791032274
    },
    {
      "id": "6ac108730000000000add976",
